{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_main_08-13_end",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "main_08-13",
  "title": "落雪，浸黑國土",
  "storyCode": "R8-11",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-13_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6f3b5967493ed27a92d84d9bdf706f89ce78f6037f79df432aa5a68ba5d6b122",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呃......給我......滾開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "巨大的潛力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘶......！我該向你脫帽致敬！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可惜，我今天忘記戴上軍帽再出門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哈，哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "再戰鬥下去也沒有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們只是烏薩斯的衛士。你現在的隊伍，你可以保留。你就作為感染者的衛士繼續生存下去。這很合理，我們各取所需。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們是什麼衛士......你們保護了誰......？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "各個國家都有自稱是衛士的人。要被保護的東西太多，自稱衛士的人也實在太多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這些人大多腐敗且無能，我們則因我們捍衛的事物而卓越。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們衛護的是烏薩斯的未來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這難道就能掩蓋你們的惡行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們犯下的罪惡罄竹難書，塞夢珂城駛入大湖，埃拉菲亞的村莊無一人能夠出逃——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我能一件接一件地指出你們的暴行，將你們做過的所有事情都公之於眾！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而就是這樣的你們，自詡國家的意志......？你們的愚癡會在未來被現實抽得粉碎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "每一個國家最後都要用鞭子去抽他們那些最懶最蠢的人。即便這樣，我們也是刀刃，不是鞭子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "剪除樹木上只懂吸取營養的無用枝條如果算是某種惡行，那我們就是惡行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你想要“曝光”我們的“行徑”。你不過是無法直面我們。何況你還會繼續改變想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們向你走來，你是否會後退？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "塔露拉......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別過來！保護戰士們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "烏薩斯的善舉與惡行並重，在你面對我們的惡行時，也要面對我們善舉培養的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一個國家絕非善惡可以衡量。在這尺度上，什麼都不值一提。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......要求你現在就達到他的高度，理解他的智慧，也並不是件現實的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "假如事情真的如他所說，到了那一日，我們會聽聽你的建議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而現在的你，除了潛力和種子，一無所有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "帝國是你沒法理解的東西，瓦伊凡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等等。瓦伊凡......不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你不會恰好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "36......【密語】！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——溫迪戈——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "兩個內衛還不足以殺死我。你如果還要和我們為敵，最好三個人一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大尉！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "推盾！前進！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不。愛國者。不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所有在場的內衛，加上在另一邊與我的女兒纏鬥的，一共有五個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道的內衛不會動搖。說話！你們對自己的實力有多少自信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們根本不想與你為敵！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "溫迪戈......你是帝國軍旅中不為常人所知的傳奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "即使移動城市的市民已經把你忘記，我們卻也還記得上代人常說的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "向你致敬，溫迪戈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......是你跟著她。雪原上的軍卒大多撒謊成性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你成為感染者的事是真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我為感染者而戰也是理所應當的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這不對，溫迪戈。這種計畫必將失敗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這個國家有著許多感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "幻想並不會因為相信它的人很多就成真。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在聲稱這種事情是幻想前，你經歷過多少次烏薩斯的失敗與勝利？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒錯。我這一代見證的並不夠多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所以......我們邀請你與我們同行。烏薩斯大尉博卓卡斯替，請跟我們走吧。烏薩斯需要你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你說什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......什......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在先皇麾下戰鬥過上百年的你，一定能回憶起那時烏薩斯的強大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那是怎樣一個繁榮偉大的時代？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們不分種族，團結在烏薩斯的名號之下，為了它的未來而戰，各式各樣的敵人倒在我們的刀刃與炮火之下，我們的確是戰無不勝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "重回那個時代的渴望是普遍的......我們都想重回那個所有人都情同兄弟同仇敵愾的時代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們能讓貪婪的諸國吐出他們掠奪的土地，讓那些飽受蹂躪的人在烏薩斯的輝澤下重獲尊嚴，我們的征服並非消滅，而是重鑄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們讓這片大地重獲新生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "讓我們重建那個時代。所有人團結起來，面對撲面而來的暴風驟雨，怎麼也好過在雪原上孤獨地苟延殘喘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這話你對現在那些被壓得抬不起頭的烏薩斯人說！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒有人過得好。這個時代就是這麼糟糕。烏薩斯的市民也飽受其苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "秩序的匱乏，力量的疏失，道德的損毀，這些都是錯誤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是這些錯誤毀掉了現在的烏薩斯，我們已經知道了問題所在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們可以糾正這些錯誤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......胡扯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你可以問問你們的首領，問他相不相信我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "博卓卡斯替，我們可以讓烏薩斯重歸正道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "錯了。現在的首領不是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是她。你要問她相不相信你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我與你們的父輩一同戰鬥過。你們的力量充沛，戰術也不比他們遜色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但你們對那時的烏薩斯充滿了幻想。這也只是，你們的幻想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你沒法否認那個時代。你的一舉一動都維繫著你與烏薩斯，即使是你的稱號也在彰示著你的意願。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那麼，你們為現在這個皇帝設想的烏薩斯裡，有沒有感染者的位置？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這種受“恩賜”所得的地位，和你們的幻想一樣，只是一時的幻象！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "塔露拉......嘶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......說得對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "也許有了你們的幫助，事情會有所不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你在......說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "利刃從不許諾。武器是不會許諾的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但我認為感染者本就是烏薩斯應該具備的力量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "各位當成為烏薩斯光榮的象徵。反對烏薩斯的感染者應被毀滅。而你們，如果你們為了烏薩斯而戰，就該被視為榮耀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "傳入塔露拉耳中的竊竊私語從沒有像現在這樣嘈雜過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只因為我不會反對你們的學說就認為我會贊同，單純是種傲慢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們是否也已經享受起了這種權力？這種肆意妄為，假定自己所做的一切都是服務於更好的時代的權力？你們憑什麼自詡光榮？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那麼，為少數人而戰，又憑什麼取得多數人的認同？你們為感染者而戰，究竟哪裡正義？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我相信你能給出有智慧的回答，溫迪戈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——正義與否與人數多寡又有何干？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "內衛，我只問一個問題，當時愛戴陛下的，又有多少人？是多是少？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而陛下之死，是否與你們有關？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果我回答“與我們無關”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看來我們解不開這個結。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不管怎樣，我的陛下已死。烏薩斯已在他人手中，且我現在追隨的，僅剩一個理念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——她的那個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "愛國者扶起塔露拉，彷彿這一刻塔露拉也是他的親人，仿佛她一直會是，直到他失去她的那一天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘶......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "為什麼是她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "因為我已與她熟識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "也許你所描述的，的確是又一條康莊大道，但這一輪，我已做過選擇。我已經選擇了感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "軍人服務於國家和信仰，而不是它的統治。所以，我將嘗試毀滅現在這個帝國，發起一場正義的戰爭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們同樣需要感染者的支援，我們的事業同樣正義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你拒絕我們的理由是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "莫非你認為現在這個“整合運動”的路，會比團結與革新更好？更有效率？還是對烏薩斯人民的傷害更小？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不。只是因為這場戰爭已經開始，而我要見到戰爭結束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "就連我所服務的仁慈的陛下也沒有接納感染者，而今我只會把類似的諾言當作謊言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果你們真能團結感染者，那麼就不會有戰爭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們希望感染者能團結在你的周圍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果你們真的想團結他們，根本用不著我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "夠了，內衛們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你說的那條路我已走過，以至於我不可能相信任何“更好的選擇”。聲稱自己有遠見的人只不過是還沒遭到命運玩弄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你們也終有一天會理解。就像那二十多個戰死在落日峽谷的內衛一樣，他們戰死在北原，死在異種手中，會比死在同胞手裡更好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我是帝國的背叛者，內衛們。我們沒有和解的可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "宣言只是宣言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "即使你是這麼想的，溫迪戈，你身後的那些人呢？會那麼信任她嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "即使他們崇尚你的武力和正直，你又如何保證，他們不是在崇拜一個有力的偶像？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是一個有力的能夠庇護他們的邪惡偶像更好，還是一個任人宰割的崇高偶像更好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "希望你不會拿前者去比喻我所尊敬的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現實比西北凍原的風雪更冷，溫迪戈。失去力量......你們只任人宰割。而且第一個對你們下手的，可能並不是你們的敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "也許他們不知道科西切是誰，但他們知道公爵，也知道公爵的女兒會是下一任公爵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你身邊的人並不是你所看到的那樣。她的力量將成長到足以對抗你，她的智謀會能和你爭鋒，她的狡詐將更勝於你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你在誇讚她嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不，溫迪戈，不......你成為烏薩斯人的時間還不夠久。你還不能理解。我是說科西切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "繼承了敗壞的知識並不意味著會隨之一同敗壞。她在雪原上留下的足跡已經證明她不會和那條老蛇一般下場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嘶......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......聽說過許多次，你很愛護年輕人，比起愛護，更接近溺愛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真正值得尊敬的人，我即使從他們的年輕看到他們的衰老與死去，我也依然尊敬他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "博卓卡斯替......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在，離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我暫時不追究你傷害我們戰士的罪，或者我們現在把你們殺死，我們等著內衛們給你們收屍，我們相互毀滅直到兩方有一方死絕——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "——即使這一方是我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......啊。溫迪戈......我沒法再說出更多秘密了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們的警告不是一種修辭，博卓卡斯替。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們只能為你哀悼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "為敵時，我該替你們，哀悼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那天不會來了，溫迪戈。那天不會來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "告辭，“愛國者”。今天的結果只令我們感到遺憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "以及，塔露拉......我們期待你進一步的變化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“皇帝的利刃”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你應該領導他們。你是合適的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "爸......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "葉蓮娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "哈，哈......我們......擊退他了......和雪怪小隊一起......哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "我們打退了一個......！不過，他是......自己撤退的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "一共只有......五個人嗎？我一個人甚至都沒法......保護好小隊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "做得好，我的女兒。下次你可以做得更好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "那一定......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "......這裡發生什麼了？為什麼所有人都......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "塔露拉？盾衛大哥們......怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......大尉......他們說的那些......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在歷史中獲取虛無縹緲的軌跡，認定未來定與歷史相同，認定身份會決定明日一切，也是自大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我願為她擔保。但其他人還一時無法接受。請諸位保守秘密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們知道！我們當然知道。我們知道塔露拉是怎麼樣一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可他們說的是......真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "難道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "......你們在想什麼？你們自己都說了！出身能決定一個人在你們心裡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "塔露拉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盾衛",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我的確曾是貴族培養的“接班人”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我已經回答過了。還有問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "領袖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "先生，別那麼叫我，我說過的。收隊吧......浮士德和弩手還有訓練過程，你要參加的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只要你的品性不讓我失望，我會支持你直到最後一刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "塔露拉......父親已經支持你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我不會要你做一樣的事的，葉蓮娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "嘁。你不會以為——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "給我顆糖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "text": "拿著。你居然向我要這個吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呵。走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "收隊吧，戰士們。如果你們想知道，我會把所有事情都......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "戰士們......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "塔露拉......\n......你有什麼陰謀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "aliases": [
        "霜星"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
